                <h3 class="title">
                    <a href="/twra/news/2026/7/31/new-courtesy-dock-completed-in-campbell-county.html" x-cq-linkchecker="skip">New Courtesy Dock Completed in Campbell County</a>
                </h3>
                <div class="date">Friday, July 31, 2026 | <small>11:13am</small></div>
                <div class="text">
                    <p>NASHVILLE --- The Tennessee Wildlife Resources Agency (TWRA) and Campbell County have completed the installation of a new courtesy dock at the Davis Cemetery Access Area. The partnership is the conclusion of a project that has been in the works for several years.</p>
                    <p>
                        <a href="/twra/news/2026/7/31/new-courtesy-dock-completed-in-campbell-county.html" class="text-button icon-right-1" x-cq-linkchecker="skip">Read More</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
    
        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-4 headlines">
            <article role="group" aria-label="news">
                <h3 class="title">
                    <a href="/tdot/news/2026/7/30/weekly-east-tennessee-construction-report-for-july-30-to-august-5--2026.html" x-cq-linkchecker="skip">Weekly East Tennessee Construction Report for July 30 to August 5, 2026</a>
                </h3>
                <div class="date">Thursday, July 30, 2026 | <small>01:27pm</small></div>
                <div class="text">
                    <p></p>
                    <p>
                        <a href="/tdot/news/2026/7/30/weekly-east-tennessee-construction-report-for-july-30-to-august-5--2026.html" class="text-button icon-right-1" x-cq-linkchecker="skip">Read More</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </article>
